<title>USA: FOCUS-Mack-Cali to rule NJ office real estate mart.</title>
<headline>FOCUS-Mack-Cali to rule NJ office real estate mart.</headline>
<byline>Robert McNatt</byline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cali Realty Corp can become the dominant player in commercial real estate in its own New Jersey market and develop a presence in Texas and Arizona through its prooposed $1.2 billion acquisition of two privately-held real estate companies.</p>
<p>Cali Realty said on Thursday it agreed to buy the office assets of Mack Co in New Jersey and Patriot American Office Group in Texas.</p>
</text>
